com/images/brand/og-default.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630},\"description\":\"Expert reviews, rankings, and smart tools for UAE residents. Your trusted guide to the best products, services, and experiences in the Emirates.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2020\",\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"United Arab Emirates\",\"@id\":\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q878\"},\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"Customer Service\",\"areaServed\":\"AE\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"en\",\"ar\"]},\"sameAs\":[]},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#website\",\"name\":\"TopTenUAE\",\"alternateName\":[\"Top Ten UAE\",\"TopTen UAE\"],\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/\",\"description\":\"Discover trending products, expert reviews, and free UAE tools. Rankings, comparisons, and calculators for smarter decisions.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://toptenuae.com/search?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#homepage\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/\",\"name\":\"TopTenUAE - The Best of the UAE, Ranked\",\"description\":\"Discover trending products, expert reviews, and free UAE tools including VAT and gratuity calculators.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"UAE Product Reviews and Comparisons\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/images/brand/og-default.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/finance-tools/uae-vat-calculator#tool\",\"name\":\"UAE VAT Calculator – 5% (2026)\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/finance-tools/uae-vat-calculator\",\"applicationCategory\":\"FinanceApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web Browser, Android, iOS\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"featureList\":[\"Add VAT to price (5% UAE rate)\",\"Remove VAT (Reverse calculation)\",\"VAT inclusive & exclusive formulas\",\"Instant VAT calculation\"],\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"image\":[\"https://toptenuae.com/images/brand/og-default.png\"],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#webpage\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is VAT calculated in UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"VAT in UAE is calculated at a standard rate of 5%. To add VAT, multiply your amount by 0.05. To get the total price (Gross), multiply the original amount by 1.05.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is 5% VAT in Dubai?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"5% VAT in Dubai is the same as the federal UAE tax. It applies to most goods and services, including food, electronics, and consulting. If you buy an item for AED 100, you will pay AED 5 in tax.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How to calculate UAE VAT in Excel?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To calculate VAT in Excel: 1) For exclusive tax, use the formula '=A1*0.05'. 2) For inclusive tax (extracting VAT), use the formula '=A1-(A1/1.05)'.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How to calculate VAT from total amount?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To calculate the pre-tax price from a total amount (reverse calculation), divide the total by 1.05. For example: 105 ÷ 1.05 = 100.\"}}]}]}</script><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50 font-sans\"><section class=\"bg-[#4b0082] relative overflow-hidden\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-white/10 blur-3xl rounded-full translate-x-1/3\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-amber-500/20 blur-3xl rounded-full -translate-x-1/3\"></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pt-12 pb-24 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-20 relative z-10\"><div class=\"mb-6\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"w-full mb-4\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Calculators\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com/finance-tools\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"UAE VAT Calculator – 5% (2026)\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com/finance-tools/uae-vat-calculator\"}]}</script><ol class=\"flex items-center text-sm space-x-2 overflow-hidden flex-wrap\"><li class=\"flex items-center shrink-0\"><a class=\"text-purple-200 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center p-1 rounded hover:bg-black/5\" title=\"Back to Homepage\" aria-label=\"Go to homepage\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Home</span></a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-purple-300/50 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center shrink-0\"><a class=\"text-purple-200 hover:text-white hover:underline transition-colors font-medium whitespace-nowrap\" title=\"View all Calculators\" href=\"/finance-tools\">Calculators</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-purple-300/50 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center min-w-0\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"truncate max-w-[150px] sm:max-w-[200px] md:max-w-md text-white font-semibold block\" title=\"UAE VAT Calculator – 5% (2026)\">UAE VAT Calculator – 5% (2026)</span></li></ol></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row items-center lg:items-start gap-12 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"flex-1 text-center lg:text-left text-white\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black leading-tight mb-6\">UAE VAT Calculator – 5% (2026)<!-- --> <br/></h1><div class=\"text-lg text-indigo-100 mb-8 leading-relaxed opacity-90 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0\"><p>Instantly calculate 5% VAT in the UAE. Ideal for Dubai &amp; Abu Dhabi businesses, freelancers, and accountants. Supports reverse VAT and Excel formulas.</p></div></div><div class=\"w-full max-w-xl shrink-0 mx-auto lg:mx-0\"><!--$?--><template id=\"B:1\"></template><div class=\"h-96 w-full bg-slate-50 rounded-xl animate-pulse\"></div><!--/$--></div></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 relative z-20\"><div id=\"tool-portal-root\" class=\"mb-12 font-sans\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 p-8 lg:p-12\"><div class=\"prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none font-sans mb-12 prose-headings:text-[#4b0082] prose-a:text-blue-600\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">How to Use the UAE VAT Calculator</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Using this UAE VAT Calculator is simple and instant. Follow these steps to calculate VAT accurately for any amount in AED:</p><ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary font-medium text-lg\"><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Enter the amount in AED</strong><br/>Input the price or invoice value you want to calculate VAT for.</li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Select “Add VAT”</strong><br/>Choose this option if your price <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">does not include VAT</strong> and you want to calculate the VAT amount and total price.</li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Select “Remove VAT”</strong><br/>Choose this option if your price <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">already includes VAT</strong> and you want to find the VAT portion and net amount.</li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">View results instantly</strong><br/>The calculator will instantly display the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">VAT amount</strong> and <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">final total</strong>.</li></ol><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">This tool is useful for <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">business owners, freelancers, shoppers, and accountants</strong> who need quick VAT calculations without manual formulas.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">What Is VAT in the UAE?</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">VAT (Value Added Tax) in the UAE is an <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">indirect tax</strong> applied to most goods and services sold in the country. It is collected at each stage of the supply chain and ultimately paid by the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">final consumer</strong>.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">The UAE introduced VAT to diversify government revenue while keeping tax rates relatively low compared to global standards. VAT is regulated by the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Federal Tax Authority (FTA)</strong>, which oversees registration, compliance, and reporting.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">VAT applies to most everyday transactions, including retail purchases, professional services, and digital products, with certain supplies treated as <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">zero-rated or exempt</strong> under UAE tax law.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">VAT in the UAE is regulated by the <a href=\"https://tax.gov.ae/en/taxes/vat.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 font-semibold hover:text-primary-700 hover:decoration-primary transition-all\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Federal Tax Authority (FTA)</strong><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3 inline ml-1 align-top opacity-70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>, which defines how VAT is applied, collected, and reported across the country.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">Who Must Charge VAT in the UAE?</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Businesses and individuals must charge VAT if they are <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">registered or required to register</strong> with the <a href=\"https://tax.gov.ae/en/taxes/Vat/vat.topics/what.is.vat.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 font-semibold hover:text-primary-700 hover:decoration-primary transition-all\">Federal Tax Authority (FTA)<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3 inline ml-1 align-top opacity-70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Typically, VAT registration becomes mandatory when taxable supplies exceed the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">FTA’s mandatory registration threshold</strong>. Once registered, the business must:</p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Charge VAT on eligible goods and services</li><li>Issue tax-compliant invoices</li><li>File VAT returns within the required timelines</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Some businesses may register <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">voluntarily</strong>, even if they are below the mandatory threshold, to improve compliance and credibility.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">⚠️ Registration requirements depend on turnover, activity type, and FTA regulations.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">How to Calculate 5% VAT in the UAE</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">The United Arab Emirates introduced Value Added Tax (VAT) at a standard rate of <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">5%</strong> under the Federal Tax Authority (FTA). This calculator helps you comply accurately with VAT-inclusive and VAT-exclusive pricing.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8 not-prose\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border bg-amber-50 border-amber-300 text-amber-900\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-3\">Adding VAT (Exclusive)</h3><p class=\"whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed opacity-90 text-sm md:text-base\">Used when pricing goods.\n\nAmount × 1.05 = Total\n\nExample: 100 × 1.05 = AED 105</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border bg-purple-50 border-purple-300 text-purple-900\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-3\">Reverse VAT (Inclusive)</h3><p class=\"whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed opacity-90 text-sm md:text-base\">How to calculate VAT from the total amount.\n\nTotal ÷ 1.05 = Base\n\nExample: 105 ÷ 1.05 = AED 100</p></div></div><div class=\"my-8\"><div class=\"hidden md:block overflow-hidden border border-gray-400 shadow-sm\"><table class=\"w-full text-base text-left border-collapse\"><thead class=\"bg-[#312e81] text-white\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-3 py-2 font-bold border-r border-indigo-700 last:border-r-0 whitespace-nowrap\">Goal</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-3 py-2 font-bold border-r border-indigo-700 last:border-r-0 whitespace-nowrap\">Excel Formula</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-3 py-2 font-bold border-r border-indigo-700 last:border-r-0 whitespace-nowrap\">Example (Cell A1 = 100)</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-200 bg-white\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 font-bold text-gray-900\">Calculate VAT Amount only</td><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 \">=A1 * 0.05</td><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 \">5.00</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 font-bold text-gray-900\">Calculate Total (with VAT)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 \">=A1 * 1.05</td><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 \">105.00</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 font-bold text-gray-900\">Remove VAT (Reverse)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 \">=A1 / 1.05</td><td class=\"px-3 py-4 border-r border-gray-400 last:border-r-0 text-gray-800 \">95.24</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"md:hidden space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 border-l-4 border-l-[#8B5CF6] rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Goal</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed font-black text-gray-900 text-lg\">Calculate VAT Amount only</span></div><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col border-b border-gray-100 \"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Excel Formula</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-800\">=A1 * 0.05</span></div><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col  \"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Example (Cell A1 = 100)</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-800\">5.00</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 border-l-4 border-l-[#8B5CF6] rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Goal</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed font-black text-gray-900 text-lg\">Calculate Total (with VAT)</span></div><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col border-b border-gray-100 \"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Excel Formula</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-800\">=A1 * 1.05</span></div><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col  \"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Example (Cell A1 = 100)</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-800\">105.00</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 border-l-4 border-l-[#8B5CF6] rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Goal</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed font-black text-gray-900 text-lg\">Remove VAT (Reverse)</span></div><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col border-b border-gray-100 \"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Excel Formula</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-800\">=A1 / 1.05</span></div><div class=\"px-5 py-5 flex flex-col  \"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Example (Cell A1 = 100)</span><span class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-800\">95.24</span></div></div></div></div><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">VAT for Freelancers &amp; Small Businesses</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Freelancers and small businesses in the UAE are <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">not automatically exempt</strong> from VAT.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">If a freelancer or sole proprietor provides taxable services and meets the FTA registration criteria, they must:</p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Register for VAT</li><li>Charge VAT on invoices</li><li>Submit VAT returns</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Common examples include:</p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Consultants</li><li>Designers &amp; developers</li><li>Marketing professionals</li><li>Independent contractors</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Freelancers working with <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">VAT-registered companies</strong> are often expected to issue VAT invoices, making registration practically necessary in many cases.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">VAT-Inclusive vs VAT-Exclusive Pricing</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Understanding VAT-inclusive and VAT-exclusive pricing is essential to avoid calculation errors.</p><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">VAT-Exclusive Price</h3><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>VAT is <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">not included</strong> in the listed price</li><li>VAT is added on top of the base amount</li><li>Common in B2B invoices</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Example:<br/>If a service costs AED 1,000 (exclusive), VAT is added to calculate the final amount.</p><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">VAT-Inclusive Price</h3><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>VAT is <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">already included</strong> in the price</li><li>The VAT portion must be extracted</li><li>Common in retail pricing</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Example:<br/>If a product costs AED 1,050 (inclusive), the VAT amount is part of that total.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">This UAE VAT Calculator supports <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">both scenarios</strong>, eliminating the need for manual formulas.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">Important VAT Disclaimer</h3><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">This calculator is provided for <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">general informational purposes only</strong> and does not constitute tax, legal, or financial advice.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">VAT rules and registration requirements are governed by the <a href=\"https://tax.gov.ae/en/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 font-semibold hover:text-primary-700 hover:decoration-primary transition-all\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Federal Tax Authority (FTA)</strong><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3 inline ml-1 align-top opacity-70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a> and may change over time. For official guidance, compliance confirmation, or complex tax situations, consult the FTA or a licensed tax professional in the UAE.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden mb-12\"><div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50\"><h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-6 h-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100\"><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">How is VAT calculated in UAE?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p>VAT in UAE is calculated at a standard rate of 5%. To add VAT, multiply your amount by 0.05. To get the total price (Gross), multiply the original amount by 1.05.\n\n</p></div></details><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">What is 5% VAT in Dubai?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p>5% VAT in Dubai is the same as the federal UAE tax. It applies to most goods and services, including food, electronics, and consulting. If you buy an item for AED 100, you will pay AED 5 in tax.</p></div></details><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">How to calculate UAE VAT in Excel?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p>To calculate VAT in Excel: 1) For exclusive tax, use the formula &#x27;=A1*0.05&#x27;. 2) For inclusive tax (extracting VAT), use the formula &#x27;=A1-(A1/1.05)&#x27;.</p></div></details><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">How to calculate VAT from total amount?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p>To calculate the pre-tax price from a total amount (reverse calculation), divide the total by 1.05. For example: 105 ÷ 1.05 = 100.</p></div></details></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 border-t border-slate-100 pt-10\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6\">More UAE Finance Tools</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border transition-all hover:shadow-md bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border-amber-200 hover:border-amber-400\" href=\"/finance-tools/gratuity-calculator-uae\"><div class=\"bg-white/60 p-3 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-coins w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M18.09 10.37A6 6 0 1 1 10.34 18\"></path><path d=\"M7 6h1v4\"></path><path d=\"m16.71 13.88.7.71-2.82 2.82\"></path></svg></div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2\">Gratuity Calculator</div><div class=\"text-sm opacity-80 font-medium\">Calculate end-of-service benefits</div></div></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border transition-all hover:shadow-md bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border-indigo-200 hover:border-indigo-400\" href=\"/finance-tools/zakat-calculator\"><div class=\"bg-white/60 p-3 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-handshake w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.414 14.414C21 12.828 22 11.5 22 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-9.591-3.676.6.6 0 0 1-.818.001A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 9.5c0 2.3 1.5 4 3 5.5l5.535 5.362a2 2 0 0 0 2.879.052 2.12 2.12 0 0 0-.004-3 2.124 2.124 0 1 0 3-3 2.124 2.124 0 0 0 3.004 0 2 2 0 0 0 0-2.828l-1.881-1.882a2.41 2.41 0 0 0-3.409 0l-1.71 1.71a2 2 0 0 1-2.828 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.828l2.823-2.762\"></path></svg></div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2\">Zakat Calculator</div><div class=\"text-sm opacity-80 font-medium\">Islamic wealth tax calculation</div></div></a></div></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></di