tools. Rankings, comparisons, and calculators for smarter decisions.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://toptenuae.com/search?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#homepage\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/\",\"name\":\"TopTenUAE - The Best of the UAE, Ranked\",\"description\":\"Discover trending products, expert reviews, and free UAE tools including VAT and gratuity calculators.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"UAE Product Reviews and Comparisons\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/images/brand/og-default.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/finance-tools/uae-vat-calculator#tool\",\"name\":\"UAE VAT Calculator – 5% (2026)\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/finance-tools/uae-vat-calculator\",\"applicationCategory\":\"FinanceApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web Browser, Android, iOS\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"featureList\":[\"Add VAT to price (5% UAE rate)\",\"Remove VAT (Reverse calculation)\",\"VAT inclusive & exclusive formulas\",\"Instant VAT calculation\"],\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"image\":[\"https://toptenuae.com/images/brand/og-default.png\"],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#webpage\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is VAT calculated in UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"VAT in UAE is calculated at a standard rate of 5%. To add VAT, multiply your amount by 0.05. To get the total price (Gross), multiply the original amount by 1.05.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is 5% VAT in Dubai?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"5% VAT in Dubai is the same as the federal UAE tax. It applies to most goods and services, including food, electronics, and consulting. If you buy an item for AED 100, you will pay AED 5 in tax.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How to calculate UAE VAT in Excel?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To calculate VAT in Excel: 1) For exclusive tax, use the formula '=A1*0.05'. 2) For inclusive tax (extracting VAT), use the formula '=A1-(A1/1.05)'.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How to calculate VAT from total amount?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To calculate the pre-tax price from a total amount (reverse calculation), divide the total by 1.05. For example: 105 ÷ 1.05 = 100.\"}}]}]}20:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2a\"}}],\"$L2b\"]\n22:null\n26:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"UAE VAT Calculator – 5% (2026) | TopTenUAE\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Instantly calculate 5% VAT in the UAE. Ideal for Dubai & Abu Dhabi businesses, freelancers, and accountants. Supports reverse VAT and Excel formulas.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"application-name\",\"content\":\"TopTenUAE\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.json\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"UAE calculator,fre