e value you want to calculate VAT for.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9995b1d2e03c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"63f91e9087e1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Select “Add VAT”\"},{\"_key\":\"a183a01eaae1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\\nChoose this option if your price \"},{\"_key\":\"267ff25a9d55\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"does not include VAT\"},{\"_key\":\"e4c9f0834e45\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" and you want to calculate the VAT amount and total price.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b2234b27b764\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b09407fefdf7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Select “Remove VAT”\"},{\"_key\":\"259f68b3f473\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\\nChoose this option if your price \"},{\"_key\":\"996c238c752d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"already includes VAT\"},{\"_key\":\"fc2f178afed4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" and you want to find the VAT portion and net amount.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"fd0082b30164\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f2b84b4c4735\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"View results instantly\"},{\"_key\":\"fba47bd77bee\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\\nThe calculator will instantly display the \"},{\"_key\":\"790e55aab4ef\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"VAT amount\"},{\"_key\":\"19b5e25e3479\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" and \"},{\"_key\":\"7218b02f5117\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"final total\"},{\"_key\":\"1617172f897d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a3c638ab7094\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"be4f918cdcad\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This tool is useful for \"},{\"_key\":\"b9ee141d7168\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"business owners, freelancers, shoppers, and accountants\"},{\"_key\":\"a1efb414199c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" who need quick VAT calculations without manual formulas.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"d0d5de37cfaf\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"68a8ff5fde58\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"What Is VAT in the UAE?\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"03efb8130fc2\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9e1d8356a349\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT (Value Added Tax) in the UAE is an \"},{\"_key\":\"fe42ee5b4eb0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"indirect tax\"},{\"_key\":\"907aecb7ee4d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" applied to most goods and services sold in the country. It is collected at each stage of the supply chain and ultimately paid by the \"},{\"_key\":\"9bb649d8e7c7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"final consumer\"},{\"_key\":\"018f5cf58421\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"252f18b31dc7\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e46963d173eb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The UAE introduced VAT to diversify government revenue while keeping tax rates relatively low compared to global standards. VAT is regulated by the \"},{\"_key\":\"a9115fb532c0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Federal Tax Authority (FTA)\"},{\"_key\":\"27e774835a72\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", which oversees registration, compliance, and reporting.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"cc1b7dc34879\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"91060f96c3e4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT applies to most everyday transactions, including retail purchases, professional services, and digital products, with certain supplies treated as \"},{\"_key\":\"62d730d6b48e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"zero-rated or exempt\"},{\"_key\":\"bb7a9a376a05\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" under UAE tax law.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b21112241544\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"45a1ad00e900\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT in the UAE is regulated by the \"},{\"_key\":\"a277a13827c5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"5cc97670bad3\"],\"text\":\"Federal Tax Authority (FTA)\"},{\"_key\":\"89981a4cba72\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", which defines how VAT is applied, collected, and reported across the country.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"5cc97670bad3\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"blank\":true,\"href\":\"https://tax.gov.ae/en/taxes/vat.aspx\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"dc8464b2b63f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"216cc745f47f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Who Must Charge VAT in the UAE?\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"0cbe09862559\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"477dab18461a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Businesses and individuals must charge VAT if they are \"},{\"_key\":\"102197631e13\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"registered or required to register\"},{\"_key\":\"4cfdc945e1de\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" with the \"},{\"_key\":\"371579d04bb4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"a29662e4be0a\"],\"text\":\"Federal Tax Authority (FTA)\"},{\"_key\":\"8ab95465a7a4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"a29662e4be0a\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"blank\":true,\"href\":\"https://tax.gov.ae/en/taxes/Vat/vat.topics/what.is.vat.aspx\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9af897a6f02a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8b78b51ff3d7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Typically, VAT registration becomes mandatory when taxable supplies exceed the \"},{\"_key\":\"29785b9f43e9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"FTA’s mandatory registration threshold\"},{\"_key\":\"3190bc0f81f0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". Once registered, the business must:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f26de4409a72\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"82f6dfe8078e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Charge VAT on eligible goods and services\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"2c8a2fa0e87a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"92105adf6c49\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Issue tax-compliant invoices\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ae8f3c5319bc\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b2782880f54c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"File VAT returns within the required timelines\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"04f7dc8ed2ef\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"29c7183a398d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Some businesses may register \"},{\"_key\":\"505f338280ce\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"voluntarily\"},{\"_key\":\"bb8240c8f41c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", even if they are below the mandatory threshold, to improve compliance and credibility.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"1791f189b068\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"af29c3c2235e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b1f1f126f765\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"7cfc02e123f3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"⚠️ Registration requirements depend on turnover, activity type, and FTA regulations.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"121a1d105081\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d81d9a1fae2a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"4fb58bf77288\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"90ff5afd22e0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"How to Calculate 5% VAT in the UAE\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"8ef52ea2aee8\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2dcc17648f0a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The United Arab Emirates introduced Value Added Tax (VAT) at a standard rate of \"},{\"_key\":\"621336a6f6ab\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"5%\"},{\"_key\":\"aa8e3fa59388\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" under the Federal Tax Authority (FTA). This calculator helps you comply accurately with VAT-inclusive and VAT-exclusive pricing.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"4a44fb3697c5\",\"_type\":\"infoCards\",\"cards\":[{\"_key\":\"b0a6c580b3e1\",\"description\":\"Used when pricing goods.\\n\\nAmount × 1.05 = Total\\n\\nExample: 100 × 1.05 = AED 105\",\"title\":\"Adding VAT (Exclusive)\",\"variant\":\"amber\"},{\"_key\":\"f04e85beb882\",\"description\":\"How to calculate VAT from the total amount.\\n\\nTotal ÷ 1.05 = Base\\n\\nExample: 105 ÷ 1.05 = AED 100\",\"title\":\"Reverse VAT (Inclusive)\",\"variant\":\"purple\"}]},{\"_key\":\"a3dff1ebbf25\",\"_type\":\"table\",\"rows\":[{\"_key\":\"12a5c3c2-0f42-4456-8cd6-0ef166b2c19b\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Goal\",\"Excel Formula\",\"Example (Cell A1 = 100)\"]},{\"_key\":\"ad504312-91f8-478c-9a29-e4e78b075fb7\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Calculate VAT Amount only\",\"=A1 * 0.05\",\"5.00\"]},{\"_key\":\"ac644e76-16e5-437d-b139-81a9feb59273\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Calculate Total (with VAT)\",\"=A1 * 1.05\",\"105.00\"]},{\"_key\":\"0c4652e5-b057-4431-a096-2d0096d6e031\",\"_type\":\"tableRow\",\"cells\":[\"Remove VAT (Reverse)\",\"=A1 / 1.05\",\"95.24\"]}]},{\"_key\":\"8bb20d53798e\",\"_type\":\"separator\",\"style\":\"line\"},{\"_key\":\"990a05a6a707\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"6d7a325994f6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT for Freelancers & Small Businesses\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"e1fab6d02b37\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a12f66f9dcb1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Freelancers and small businesses in the UAE are \"},{\"_key\":\"7c55d396ee2a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"not automatically exempt\"},{\"_key\":\"d365a18f1b3e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" from VAT.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9cc07e5b7b49\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"6028769218c3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"If a freelancer or sole proprietor provides taxable services and meets the FTA registration criteria, they must:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"cf5c0d7d458b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"70fa886ac507\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Register for VAT\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a8d6aeb822db\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"63533c6d2e28\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Charge VAT on invoices\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"2c314ec5febe\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0f0c65016ab7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Submit VAT returns\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"bea6e045d762\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1aca5ac83a42\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Common examples include:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"704370003c7b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3c87e171dbdb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Consultants\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e318a00ec985\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3caac998008f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Designers & developers\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"8790fbb3ec8d\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"83ebe2c65021\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Marketing professionals\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c9c5a3ef7ccb\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1aa39449bd4d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Independent contractors\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"01251b6d506e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"56029252216e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Freelancers working with \"},{\"_key\":\"73c085e681cb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"VAT-registered companies\"},{\"_key\":\"20a2724637ee\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" are often expected to issue VAT invoices, making registration practically necessary in many cases.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"848c76cb4a66\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9fdbe3df03db\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT-Inclusive vs VAT-Exclusive Pricing\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"b6686772bd58\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0180acd93a5b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Understanding VAT-inclusive and VAT-exclusive pricing is essential to avoid calculation errors.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"eb8c7676ebf5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d804efa331ef\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT-Exclusive Price\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"901476baa42a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"db2f7033645f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT is \"},{\"_key\":\"c53b405ac4dd\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"not included\"},{\"_key\":\"e9d05f5cdb86\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" in the listed price\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b000095d9cca\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"717ae01fc5f0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT is added on top of the base amount\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b0261ab07b11\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5f342690cb2f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Common in B2B invoices\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"8fc3040ee6b4\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3d9b43d4a832\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Example:\\nIf a service costs AED 1,000 (exclusive), VAT is added to calculate the final amount.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9b630741e14e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"079f41a7bca9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT-Inclusive Price\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"a352c9dcdffc\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d42d8f7d07e5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT is \"},{\"_key\":\"6cb3000fb3f9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"already included\"},{\"_key\":\"1176db449286\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" in the price\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"6dd7228d627f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"be7128e4bf3f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The VAT portion must be extracted\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"05de3ab809c6\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5c907b5a2841\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Common in retail pricing\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f9696c061a95\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"7ac38e12f5cd\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Example:\\nIf a product costs AED 1,050 (inclusive), the VAT amount is part of that total.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c3bca817f15c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b9471df59845\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This UAE VAT Calculator supports \"},{\"_key\":\"6ccd93254164\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"both scenarios\"},{\"_key\":\"a0681da138a2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", eliminating the need for manual formulas.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a0514f07993b\",\"_type\":\"separator\",\"style\":\"line\"},{\"_key\":\"aa745932e528\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"4cbdee449938\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Important VAT Disclaimer\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"70bc14fd3efb\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"31a2dc2caf01\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This calculator is provided for \"},{\"_key\":\"4a9c938440b2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"general informational purposes only\"},{\"_key\":\"34c7198a51d7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" and does not constitute tax, legal, or financial advice.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"97d14030dafb\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"812f4916d3ba\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"VAT rules and registration requirements are governed by the \"},{\"_key\":\"54537c58c1c5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"4253c1692c96\"],\"text\":\"Federal Tax Authority (FTA)\"},{\"_key\":\"210aafa8a6dc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" and may change over time. For official guidance, compliance confirmation, or complex tax situations, consult the FTA or a licensed tax professional in the UAE.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"4253c1692c96\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"blank\":true,\"href\":\"https://tax.gov.ae/en/default.aspx\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"}]}]}],\"$L10\",\"$L11\"]}]]}]\nd:null\n10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\",\"children\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"items\":[{\"_key\":\"0d389f3360d0\",\"answer\":\"VAT in UAE is calculated at a standard rate of 5%. To add VAT, multiply your amount by 0.05. To get the total price (Gross), multiply the original amount by 1.05.\\n\\n\",\"question\":\"How is VAT calculated in UAE?\"},{\"_key\":\"246f1142be14\",\"answer\":\"5% VAT in Dubai is the same as the federal UAE tax. It applies to most goods and services, including food, electronics, and consulting. If you buy an item for AED 100, you will pay AED 5 in tax.\",\"question\":\"What is 5% VAT in Dubai?\"},{\"_key\":\"69981508c314\",\"answer\":\"To calculate VAT in Excel: 1) For exclusive tax, use the formula '=A1*0.05'. 2) For inclusive tax (extracting VAT), use the formula '=A1-(A1/1.05)'.\",\"question\":\"How to calculate UAE VAT in Excel?\"},{\"_key\":\"531884cbf553\",\"answer\":\"To calculate the pre-tax price from a total amount (reverse calculation), divide the total by 1.05. For example: 105 ÷ 1.05 = 100.\",\"question\":\"How to calculate VAT from total amount?\"}],\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"icon\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-ci